  glm53_hpu/dsa.py
  glm53_hpu/tests/test_dsa_core.py
      dsa.py is a revision of ports/glm-5-mxfp4/glm5_hpu/glm5_hpu/dsa.py of the gaudi-cookbook
      (https://github.com/thediymaker/gaudi-cookbook, commit 1540263). Its header lists the changes.
      test_dsa_core.py tests it.

  glm53_hpu/draft_chain.py
      Its early_draft function extends decode_lean.early_draft of the same gaudi-cookbook port.

  glm53_hpu/fastlink.py
      Its last-stage forward follows HPUModelRunner._execute_model_generic of vllm-gaudi
      (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi, releases/v0.30.0 at 058f107) as patched by the
      gaudi-cookbook's pipeline-parallel fix.

  patches/engine_skip_empty.py
  patches/engine_single_batch.py
  patches/engine_wave.py
      Contain source text of EngineCore from vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm, commit ced6857a)
      and modified versions of it.

  serving/cookbook_gates/glm5_gates.py
  serving/cookbook_gates/run_gates.sh
      From ports/glm-5-mxfp4/tests/hpu/ of the gaudi-cookbook. glm5_gates.py has API-key support added;
      run_gates.sh is unchanged.

  image/Dockerfile.base
      Follows .cd/Dockerfile.ubuntu.pytorch.vllm of vllm-gaudi, with the base image and both source commits
      pinned.

Data:

  serving/cookbook_gates/gsm8k50.json
